WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,660
Hou Fu, find a reliable craftsman to re-make the wheelchair according to this drawing, using the best materials.

2
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:10,620
Yes, how to deal with this?

3
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:14,091
Send someone to check out the wooden shop on that street.

4
00:00:14,091 --> 00:00:17,294
Anyone who has ever given a wheelchair to Pingning Houfu

5
00:00:17,294 --> 00:00:18,896
Dare to cut corners

6
00:00:18,896 --> 00:00:20,231
Check one by one

7
00:00:20,231 --> 00:00:21,833
Don't let anyone go

8
00:00:21,833 --> 00:00:22,100
Yes

9
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:30,060
Send it home quietly.

10
00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:36,460
Sister-in-law, I heard that the prince went to the hospital to see you yesterday afternoon, but is there anything important?

11
00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:40,790
It's nothing, it's just that he was anxious to set the wedding date.

12
00:00:40,790 --> 00:00:45,710
The sixth day of next month is a very urgent day, so urgent?

13
00:00:45,710 --> 00:00:50,310
Qingqing is just afraid that the wedding date is too late and her aunt will be too tired to take care of it.
